  "title": "DE STAAT - FREEDOM (Official Music Video)",
  "content": "<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKO4pQtIXow\">DE STAAT - FREEDOM (Official Music Video)</a></strong></p>\nOK well this is a first for me... at <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKO4pQtIXow&amp;t=44s\">00:44</a> in this new music video by Dutch alternative rock band <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_Staat\">De Staat</a>:</p>\n<p><video controls=\"1\" height=\"720\" loop=\"1\" poster=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/freedom-pelican-poster.jpg\" preload=\"none\" src=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/freedom-pelican.mp4\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: auto;\" width=\"1280\"> </video>\n</p>\n<p>The visual effects are credited to Matties Grooten of <a href=\"https://fakeitorleaveit.com\">Fake it or Leave it</a>.\n\n    <p><small></small>Via <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50186129#50193407\">flir on Hacker News</a></small></p>\n\n\n    <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/music\">music</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai\">ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/generative-ai\">generative-ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/pelican-riding-a-bicycle\">pelican-riding-a-bicycle</a></p>",
